    fix(consensus): bound eviction ancestry and protect indeterminate chains
    
    Use retained-map cardinality, not a new protocol limit, for both ancestry walks. Preserve committed, lock and QC protections, refuse uncertain slot admission without accounting mutation, and retain legacy capacity semantics. Voting semantics are unchanged.
    
